    overflow-y = ScrollOverflow.clip

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Box ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint-self
    - canvas Canvas

canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#e2e8f0")
canvas.stroke-color = null
for row in 0 .. < 14
    for column in 0 .. < 44
        if (row + column) % 2 == 0
            canvas.rect(Rect(bounds.x + column * 18, bounds.y + row * 18, 18, 18))

